    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create <strong>Accordion</strong> or <strong>FAQs</strong> section, insert <strong>SVG icon</strong> from 1800+ SVG icons library or upload a custom SVG icon, create iconic button, Embed <strong>Google map</strong> without any API key &#8211; these everythings, you can do in Gutenberg block editor with <strong>Native Blocks</strong>. Clean native interface and settings, optimized for performance, minimal look without any complexcity.</p>\n<h3>Blocks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accordion:</strong> Create collapsible Accordion or FAQs section</li>\n<li><strong>SVG Icon:</strong> Insert or upload custom SVG and style interface</li>\n<li><strong>Map:</strong> Embed a nice Google map without any API</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<p>e.g.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/native-blocks</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='are%20the%20blocks%20responsive%3F'>\nAre the blocks Responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the blocks are responsive.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='are%20they%20are%20optimized%20for%20speed'>\nAre they are optimized for Speed\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, they are optimized for Speed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create SVG Icon, Accordion or Embed Google map with Native Blocks",
    "description": "<p>Create <strong>Accordion</strong> or <strong>FAQs</strong> section, insert <strong>SVG icon</strong> from 1800+ SVG icons library or upload a custom SVG icon, create iconic button, Embed <strong>Google map</strong> without any API key &#8211; these everythings, you can do in Gutenberg block editor with <strong>Native Blocks</strong>. Clean native interface and settings, optimized for performance, minimal look without any complexcity.</p>\n<h3>Blocks</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Accordion:</strong> Create collapsible Accordion or FAQs section</li>\n<li><strong>SVG Icon:</strong> Insert or upload custom SVG and style interface</li>\n<li><strong>Map:</strong> Embed a nice Google map without any API</li>\n</ul>\n",
